{
  "text": " I find everything that's happening right now that be fascinating. Especially when it comes to biotech. Like they are finding new cures to things and new advancements like every single day. It's unbelievable. I learned about something called longevity, escape, voila. A conservative estimate is when I reach that date in 2032, just a few years from now. Some people say 2030 and that's the date at which it is no longer reasonable to die, which is very interesting. So every year, so, apparently every year that you age, you lose a year, of course, of your lifetime. But because of advancements, we were gaining back like five months. And that's going to overtake in just a few years. It's unbelievable. Like they have like robots now the size of a grain of rice that will go inside of you and destroy kidney stone. The amount of stuff out there is just like blowing my mind.",
